            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioners, petitioners allege that Chicago used an unlawful cutoff score in its firefighter hiring exams, which had an adverse impact on qualified Black applicants."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Respondent (City)",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "bb10bb3787805531945c6a27f317acc3e8c6792385657e8844595bbba64285d7",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-bb10bb378780-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 24,
              "start": 24
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Respondent (City), according to Respondent (City), the City of Chicago publicly admitted that the tiered eligibility list had an adverse impact on African\u2011Americans."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioners",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "bb10bb3787805531945c6a27f317acc3e8c6792385657e8844595bbba64285d7",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-bb10bb378780-0000-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 11,
              "start": 11
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The statute of limitations for a Title VII claim is 300 days after each use of the discriminatory test."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "bb10bb3787805531945c6a27f317acc3e8c6792385657e8844595bbba64285d7",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-bb10bb378780-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 37,
              "start": 37
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The City made 149 hires from the first use of the list, more than any other class."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Ms. Solomon",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "bb10bb3787805531945c6a27f317acc3e8c6792385657e8844595bbba64285d7",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-bb10bb378780-0001-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 37,
              "start": 37
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Their hiring will be delayed, possibly substantially."
      }
